{
  "title": "SQS · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "처리할 작업을 큐에 보관해 생산자와 처리자를 분리합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>SQS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Queue Service)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#guide-1\">메시지를 처리하는 과정</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#guide-2\">순서·중복·실패 관리</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>통합</span><span>51 / 62</span></div><h1>SQS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Queue Service)</span></h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>SQS는 <strong>처리할 메시지를 큐에 보관하는 관리형 서비스</strong>입니다. 요청을 만드는 쪽과 실제로 처리하는 쪽이 동시에 같은 속도로 동작하지 않아도 되도록 중간에서 작업을 저장합니다.</p><p>주문 후 이메일 발송이나 이미지 변환처럼 시간이 걸리는 작업을 큐에 넣으면, 사용자 요청을 받는 서버와 작업 서버를 분리해 확장할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"standard-queues\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"fifo-queues\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"message-group-id-and-deduplication-id\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"visibility-timeout\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"receipt-handle-and-deletion\"></span><h2>메시지를 처리하는 과정</h2><p>생산자가 큐에 메시지를 보내면 소비자가 메시지를 받아 작업합니다. 작업이 성공하면 메시지를 삭제하고, 실패해 삭제하지 못하면 나중에 다시 받을 수 있습니다.</p><p>메시지를 받은 뒤에는 가시성 제한 시간<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup> 동안 다른 소비자에게 일시적으로 보이지 않게 합니다. 처리 시간에 맞춰 이 값을 정하고 긴 작업은 필요하면 연장합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"short-polling-and-long-polling\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"delay-queues-and-message-timers\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"retention-and-large-payloads\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"encryption-policies-and-scaling\"></span><h2>순서·중복·실패 관리</h2><p><strong>Standard 큐</strong>는 높은 처리량을 제공하지만 중복 전달과 순서 변경을 고려해야 합니다. <strong>FIFO 큐</strong>는 메시지 그룹 안의 순서와 중복 제거 기능이 필요한 경우 사용합니다.</p><p>어떤 큐를 쓰더라도 재처리 시 결과가 잘못되지 않도록 작업을 설계합니다. 반복 실패한 메시지는 DLQ로 분리하고, 긴 폴링으로 빈 조회를 줄일 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>작업을 큐로 분리</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>생산자</strong><span>처리할 메시지 전송</span></li><li><strong>SQS 큐</strong><span>처리 전까지 보관</span></li><li><strong>소비자</strong><span>처리 성공 후 삭제</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">큐에 쌓인 작업량과 처리 속도를 보고 소비자 수를 늘릴 수 있습니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>문서 업로드 요청을 받으면 변환 작업을 SQS에 넣고 먼저 접수를 완료합니다. 작업 서버는 큐에서 메시지를 받아 변환하고, 성공한 메시지만 삭제합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>가시성 제한 시간</strong> — 소비자가 받은 메시지를 다른 소비자에게 숨기는 기간입니다. 메시지를 삭제하지 않고 시간이 지나면 다시 처리 대상으로 나타날 수 있습니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/welcome.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon Simple Queue Service? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q071/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q071\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q071\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q071</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q071/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order API hands work to asynchronous workers and must retry tasks when a worker fails. Which service should buffer the work?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a>로 생산자와 소비자를 분리하고 메시지 삭제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\">visibility timeout</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q072\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q072\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q072</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q072/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A worker receives an SQS message but fails before deleting it. What generally happens?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The message disappears permanently</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A new message is always inserted at the back of the queue</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The message automatically moves to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The message can be received again after the visibility timeout</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 메시지는 삭제 전까지 큐에 남고 숨김 시간이 끝나면 다시 보일 수 있다. 표준 큐에서는 순서를 가정하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q073\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q073\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q073</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q073/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">The same event must reach separate SQS queues for an email service and an analytics service. Which pattern is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS Multi-Attach volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Subscribe both SQS queues to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Duplicate one ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Connect two workers to a single SQS queue only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a>→여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐가 각 소비자 그룹에 사본을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1,2\" data-question=\"Q091\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q091\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q091</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q091/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO SQS settings help recover from temporary message-processing failures?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q091\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Copy an AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q091\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A dead-letter queue for repeated failures</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q091\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An appropriate visibility timeout</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q091\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Delete messages immediately on receipt</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q091\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address on a network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B, C</strong> · 처리 시간에 맞게 숨김 시간을 두고 반복 실패는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>로 격리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,1\" data-question=\"Q092\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q092\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q092</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q092/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order event must be processed independently by several services. Which TWO components are central to the design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A separate SQS queue for each consumer service</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish the event to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">All workers share the same ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Move one EBS volume between AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Remove every network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>과 소비자별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐를 조합한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">이전 용어 <b>SNS</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">다음 용어 <b>Step Functions</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
